abstract: "Locally frozen software and data snapshot supplied as Supplementary Material 2 for the Optimization Methods and Software manuscript. Retains historical numerical analyses and adds a controlled row-only Ruiz comparison, a final-policy implementation check, three physical precision scenarios, and an activation-row follow-up with exact feasible witnesses and controlled accuracy tests. An auxiliary common-incumbent diagnostic adds 36 stored MILP calls and 18 LP checks to qualify mechanism attribution. A matched IntegralityFocus control and full workflow measurement add 12 principal calls and 12 retained instrumentation calls. A fully matched six-model accuracy/remedy comparison adds 144 terminal comparisons and one retained externally interrupted attempt. The snapshot is not a published Zenodo release and has no assigned DOI. Code is MIT; data are CC BY 4.0; the manuscript is outside those licenses."
